WEBVTT

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:10.620
Today is the Junior Class 
finals at LDS's Center Court!

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:16.950
It's LDS's Layra vs You 
Show School's Tatsuya!

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:21.030
Do your best to win the championship!

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.840
Tatsuya, be careful!

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.800
Your opponent will use Fusion!

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:27.260
He might also use Synchro!

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:32.560
Layra can use various summoning methods.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.350
But I have a secret strategy.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:44.730
I want Tatsuya to win, but what's 
going on with Yuzu and Yuya?

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:49.880
Mieru and Michy both said Yuya's name 
with a serious look on their faces.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:51.440
Can it be?

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.800
What?

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.830
Is Yuya...

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:57.940
...having Michy cook him a meal?

00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:01.340
He's so lucky!  It's not fair!

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:17.860
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:23.040
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:26.100
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:30.350
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:33.090
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.760
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.560
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:49.670
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:55.140
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:55.510 --> 00:02:00.750
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:04.890
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.820
Repeating Up/Down

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:11.160
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:18.430
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:21.870
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:26.870
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:33.950
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:44.460
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:47.160
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.860
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:52.670
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:55.440
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:03.960
Wounded Falcon

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.170
This is the end!

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:11.240
Go!  Battle, Frightfur Tiger!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:14.030
Attack Force Strix!

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:18.080
Finish Kurosaki, the Xyz refugee!

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:19.540
Kurosaki?

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:54.960
I win this time.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.330
You're badly hurt!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:04.360
Move out of the way, Yuzu.

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:07.050
Kurosaki is my prey.

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.500
That Duel Disk...

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:14.400
Are you Serena?

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:16.810
The spell card Lunar Eclipse!

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:20.150
Shadows envelop the player's field.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.120
Serena!

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:41.420
Are you okay?

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:47.060
Won't let you me finish him 
off in peace and quiet?

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.970
You're going to get hurt too.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.520
Now's our chance.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.720
You're in my way.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:07.320
I came to get in your way.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:11.460
Duel!

00:05:15.200 --> 00:05:17.930
Why are you saving me?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:22.010
When we accept a task, we will 
risk our lives to complete it.

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.840
That is the code of the Fuma Clan.

00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:30.140
We need Serena when we 
negotiate with Academia.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.980
We must do whatever it takes to protect her.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:35.000
How many enemies are left?

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:39.620
We've confirmed four, including Sora Shiunin.

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.200
Yuzu!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.950
She's not here either.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:48.260
Hey, are you okay?

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:51.140
Wake up!

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.760
Leave her be.

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.400
She's not in the battle royal anyway.

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:58.260
It's dangerous to leave her like this.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.870
There are others mixed up in this tournament.

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:05.110
Let's take her to a safe place, Teppei!

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:08.080
I have to help?

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.940
That's Serena.  Good luck.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.600
You're not coming with us?

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.460
It's too much trouble.

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.830
There are a lot of cameras on the field.

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.080
Serena.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.760
Please do not resist.

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:34.200
We just want you to come home.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.480
If you want me to come 
back, then do it by force!

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:42.140
I guess we have no choice.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.020
Duel!

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:50.200
I summon Edge Imp Saw!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.240
I'll end this quick so I can leave.

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:56.460
I won't let you.

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:00.160
I'll go first.

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:01.460
My turn!

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:04.420
I summon Twilight Ninja 
Shingetsu from my hand!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.470
I set three cards and end my turn.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:11.900
My turn!

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:16.450
I summon Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:24.190
When there's a monster on your field,

00:07:24.190 --> 00:07:28.740
this card deals you 600 points 
of damage once per turn!

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.160
Hound Flame!

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:35.170
I activate my Continuous Trap Barrier 
Ninjitsu Art of Extinguishment!

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:38.000
It negates effect damage 
that's 800 points or less!

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:43.310
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:49.230
I fuse three Ancient Gear Hunting Hounds, 
one on the field and two in my hand!

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:55.480
Inheriting the souls of the past, these 
hunting dogs were turned into machines.

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:59.580
Form a pack and be reborn with new power!

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.290
Fusion Summon!

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:07.160
Appear, Level 7 Triple 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:09.440
Battle!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:14.770
Before we do, I activate the Continuous Trap 
Barrier Ninjitsu Art of Gathering Shadows!

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:19.660
Once per your turn, I can end the Battle 
Phase by paying half my life points!

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:20.380
What?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.310
You...

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:28.050
Compared to your injuries, this is nothing.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:32.340
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:36.680
The spell card Ninjitsu 
Art of Hazy Duplication!

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:40.510
I Special Summon one Level 
4-or-below Ninja from my hand.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:45.030
I Special Summon Twilight Ninja Shingetsu.

00:08:50.110 --> 00:08:51.570
Fusion Summon!

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:57.360
Appear, Level 7 Triple 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.050
Let's battle!

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:02.280
Due to Barrier Ninjitsu Art 
of Gathering Shadows's effect,

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:05.890
I pay half my life points 
to end the Battle Phase!

00:09:08.120 --> 00:09:14.960
I tribute Twilight Ninja Shingetsu to 
Tribute Summon Twilight Ninja Nichirin, the Chunin!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.030
Fusion Summon!

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:23.800
Appear, Level 7 Triple 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.910
I activate Barrier Ninjitsu 
Art of Gathering Shadows!

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:34.220
Damn.  I set three cards and end my turn!

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:38.110
Why go this far?

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.420
It's proceeding as planned.

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:44.390
My brother Hikage is like the sun, 
attacking to hold off the invasion.

00:09:44.710 --> 00:09:49.370
I'm like the moon, defending 
to stop the enemy's attack.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:52.370
Then it's my turn.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.240
My turn!

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:58.330
I activate the spell card Polymerization!

00:09:58.810 --> 00:10:04.600
I fuse Lunalight Blue Cat and 
Lunalight Purple Butterfly!

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:10.660
The cat loitering in the blue darkness!  
The butterfly with purple poison!

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:15.300
Swirl in the moon's gravity 
and be reborn with new power!

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.920
Fusion Summon!

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:22.360
Appear, the beautiful beast 
that dances in the moonlight!

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.620
Lunalight Cat Dancer!

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:40.320
I knew she'd use fusion that 
she learned at Academia.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:45.900
Who are they?

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:49.570
They're the Academia that Yuya mentioned.

00:10:49.570 --> 00:10:53.630
You said we'd go somewhere safe, but we're 
at the most dangerous place instead!

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:57.070
I activate the spell card Lunalight Perfume!

00:10:57.540 --> 00:11:00.640
I Special Summon a Lunalight 
monster from my graveyard.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:03.310
I Special Summon Blue Cat!

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:08.100
When Blue Cat is Special Summoned,

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:13.680
one Lunalight monster's attack points 
are doubled until the end of the turn!

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.920
I select Cat Dancer!

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:21.180
The steel teeth that house the devil,

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:26.460
become one with the beast that bears its 
fangs and show your new power and look!

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:28.370
Fusion Summon!

00:11:28.770 --> 00:11:33.310
Appear, the king of beasts 
that slashes everything!

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:37.240
Frightfur Leo!

00:11:42.620 --> 00:11:43.840
Sora!

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:56.590
Lunalight Cat Dancer's effect activates!

00:11:56.800 --> 00:12:03.560
By tributing Blue Cat, it can 
attack all your monsters twice!

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:04.620
Let's battle!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:08.460
Cat Dancer attacks Triple 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:09.400
That's pointless.

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:11.910
I activate the trap card Fusion Dispersal!

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.180
What?  Fusion Dispersal?

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:19.870
Your attacking Fusion Monster reverts back 
to the monsters that created it,

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:22.080
and the battle ends.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:29.290
And you take damage equal to the 
one with the most attack points!

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:36.800
We already know everything about your deck.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.230
There's nothing you can do.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:40.940
Let's hurry!

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.180
Why?

00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:46.540
Battling them won't earn 
us a single Pendulum Card.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.780
But our friends are in trouble.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:51.080
You're right.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:56.020
Our strength will get them out of 
trouble... is not what will happen!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:57.990
Sora!

00:12:58.150 --> 00:12:59.570
Hey Sora!

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:04.560
What's wrong with you?  What are you doing?

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:09.040
Why are you turning those 
you defeat into cards?

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:13.130
What you're doing isn't forgivable!

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:14.510
Say something!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.740
Look over here!

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:16.990
Sora!

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:20.570
Will you wait until I defeat him?

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:22.480
Stop messing around!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:23.480
Hey, don't!

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:25.850
Stop, Yuya!

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:26.650
Let me go!

00:13:28.010 --> 00:13:28.880
Yuya!

00:13:28.880 --> 00:13:29.940
What is it?

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:31.400
Yuzu is over there!

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:36.460
Yuzu!

00:13:36.840 --> 00:13:38.420
I end my turn.

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:41.440
Let's go!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:43.070
No!

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.840
We're your opponents!

00:13:49.520 --> 00:13:52.140
Penalty for intruding: 2000 points.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:59.850
I didn't do anything, but 
I lost 2000 life points!

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:02.230
My turn!

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:05.460
I activate the spell card Minute Meal!

00:14:05.930 --> 00:14:08.510
I can Special Summon Royal 
Cookpals from my hand

00:14:08.510 --> 00:14:14.480
whose Levels are equal or less 
than your monsters' total Level!

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:19.710
So I'm bringing out all my 
Level 21-or-below monsters!

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:23.900
Royal Cookpal Knight Pasta!

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:27.000
Royal Cookpal Queen Omelet!

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:30.060
Royal Cookpal King Burger!

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:33.660
I set one card to finish my preparations.

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:37.520
You're not skilled enough to oppose us.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.520
You shouldn't underestimate us.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:41.670
Right, Teppei?

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.450
You caused me to draw!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:49.100
I activate the Continuous Spell Inlet!

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:53.820
The Level of a Water Attribute monster 
in my hand or field decreases by 1.

00:14:53.820 --> 00:15:00.470
I lower the Level 5 The Legendary Fisherman 
in my hand to Level 4 and summon it!

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:08.290
By tributing The Legendary Fisherman,

00:15:08.290 --> 00:15:11.890
I can Special Summon The 
Legendary Fisherman III!

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:15.920
Be reborn with the legend 
that was handed down to you!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:18.090
The Legendary Fisherman III!

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:20.810
When this monster is Special Summoned,

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:24.200
I can banish as many monsters 
on your field as I like!

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:25.300
What?

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:28.600
Catch all three in a single haul!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.730
Nicely done, Teppei.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:39.700
I activate the trap card Monster Pie!

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:42.540
When there's a Cookpal on my field,

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:50.000
I Special Summon a Monster Pie Token on 
your field for every monster you lost.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.460
What?

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:55.090
Royal Cookpals' effects activate!

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:59.840
When a monster is summoned on your field,

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:06.540
I can destroy one of your monsters for every 
Royal Cookpal that I return to my hand!

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:10.410
I'll add this effect on top of that!

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:15.950
By sending all banished 
cards to your graveyards,

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:19.650
The Legendary Fisherman III 
doubles the damage you take!

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:25.560
When Monster Pie Token is destroyed, 
you take 1000 points of damage!

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:26.200
That means...

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:29.040
Damage is doubled to 2000 points!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.470
We're the greatest team.

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:37.920
Of course, partner!

00:16:40.170 --> 00:16:45.490
Your greatest teamwork 
has led to your demise.

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:46.460
What?

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:49.400
I flip over all my set cards!

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:54.170
I activate the Continuous Trap Ancient 
Gear Reborn, Ancient Gear Spark Shot

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:57.250
and Ancient Gear Booster!

00:16:57.540 --> 00:17:05.030
Gear Reborn's effect resurrects Triple Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound with 200 extra attack points!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:12.690
Then due to Gear Spark Shot's effect, you 
take damage equal to half its attack points.

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:16.780
But Gear Booster doubles the damage!

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.750
Take 2000 points of damage!

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:22.800
Antique Revive Howling!

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:33.600
Michy!

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.370
Michy...

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.950
You shouldn't have interfered.

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:51.820
Stop it!

00:17:58.270 --> 00:17:59.120
Michy...

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:02.240
Yuzu is in danger!  I'll go!

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:03.880
Sora!

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:05.360
Please stop!

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:07.020
What you're doing is horrible!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.160
Be quiet!

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:15.160
You'll face the same fate.

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.720
I activate the Continuous Trap 
Gear Reborn and Gear Booster

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:24.120
and combo it with Spark Shot to finish you.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:27.960
Take this!  Antique Revive Howling!

00:18:41.440 --> 00:18:43.920
Why did you turn into a card?

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:47.170
You said we were the greatest team.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:53.600
You're a team in card form forever.

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:07.480
We're done too.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:10.420
I activate Frightfur Leo's effect!

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:13.720
Once per turn, your monster is destroyed,

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:17.750
and you take damage equal 
to its attack points!

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.510
I'm finished!

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.450
Sora!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.240
You're next.

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:12.320
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Ancient Gear Reborn!

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:14.690
I Special Summon Triple Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:18.190
from the graveyard 
with 200 extra attack points!

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:24.760
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Ancient Gear Spark Shot!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:28.500
Take this!  Antique Revive Howling!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.560
Stop right there!

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.990
The Action Spell Flame Guard!

00:20:36.990 --> 00:20:39.290
Effect damage is negated!

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:45.970
Now that I'm here, you have incredible power!

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.770
I heard what's going on from Reiji Akaba!

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.670
Penalty for intruding: 2000 points.

00:20:56.090 --> 00:20:59.580
I didn't hear about this!

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:08.220
I'll prove that I'm the strongest in LDS...

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:17.370
What you're doing is wrong.

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:27.650
Use your power to bring smiles to the future.

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:33.710
Smile...

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:38.680
Sora, duel me.

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:44.120
Fine.  Because I don't like 
losing to you all the time.

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:48.280
Let's go to a place where 
no one will interfere.

00:21:59.840 --> 00:22:03.480
I'll duel to make you smile once again!

00:22:06.340 --> 00:22:07.540
Duel!

00:22:28.270 --> 00:22:32.910
As long as there's a smile

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.680
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:42.120 --> 00:22:44.990
I always believe

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:48.520
In my tomorrow

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:54.130
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:22:57.400 --> 00:23:02.770
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:09.640
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:16.320
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:16.850 --> 00:23:20.390
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:50.640
Sora, remember the first time we dueled!

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:53.100
I was messing around back then.

00:23:53.520 --> 00:23:56.840
But I won't go easy on you anymore.

00:23:56.840 --> 00:23:58.760
Bring it on, Yuya!

00:23:58.760 --> 00:24:00.920
Your smile was real back then!

00:24:01.160 --> 00:24:05.120
I'll make you smile for real again!

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:10.780
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Smile by Dueling

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:13.080
The fun is only getting started!
